# ArcGIS Location Platform API key — powers the Esri basemap under the globe.
# Get a free one at https://location.arcgis.com (Location Platform → API keys); it needs
# the "basemaps" privilege. NEXT_PUBLIC_* is inlined into the client bundle at build time,
# so this key ships to every visitor: restrict it by HTTP referrer before deploying, and
# set it at BUILD time on your host (Vercel etc.), not at runtime.
# Leave it empty and the globe still renders — it falls back to keyless Natural Earth land.
NEXT_PUBLIC_ARCGIS_API_KEY=

# Optional, build-tooling only: `npm run covers` uses TMDB to resolve film/series
# posters into content/covers.json (which is committed, so you rarely need this).
# Free key: https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api
TMDB_API_KEY=
